1.5

A scheduled task was created to boot a hidden Linux VM every night under the highest available privilege level.

What is the name of that task?


ProcessEvents
| where timestamp >= datetime(2026-01-11T14:35:33.000Z)
| where process_commandline  has "/create"
//| where process_commandline  has_any ("vm", "virtualbox", "vbox", "hyper-v", "wsl", "linux")
//| where hostname contains "WHD-PROD-01"
| where process_commandline  has "schtasks"
| order by timestamp asc
| distinct process_commandline

schtasks /create /tn "TPMProfiler" /tr "C:\\Users\\Public\\tmp\\qemu-system-x86_64.exe -m 1G -smp 1 -hda C:\\Users\\Public\\tmp\\vault.db -device e1000,netdev=net0 -netdev user,id=net0,hostfwd=tcp::22022-:22" /sc daily /st 21:00 /ru SYSTEM /f


